    "source": {
      "prompt": "Nexus City from the concept image: keep its districts, water and transit layout, and add a sky tube loop linking the corporate core and the spaceport.",
      "image": "reference/nexus_city_concept.webp",
      "notes": "Image scale bar implies about 14 km across; clamped to 3.4 km (11.6 km2) per the scope's default city size. 'Arasaka' tower label dropped (third-party IP); Kaze, Mirai and Helios kept as corporate tower names. Kurosawa Hills kept as a place name only (flat ground in v1). M1a: the concept has open water along the whole west side (West Bay) with the spaceport on its northwest shore; the M0 south_west bay at 18% sea left the northwest corner inland, so the coast now opens to the west (sea_share 0.24) and the Sentinel Canal is pinned to reach the bay in the southwest (to.at 0.2), as in the concept. M1a2: the Kurosawa River enters near the northeast corner (from.at 0.42) and runs south along the east side to join the Sentinel Canal downstream, as in the concept; the land east of it is Midtown's bank, so the entry point sets Midtown's share."
    },
